post_install() {
  cat <<'EOF'
Aercast selective System Audio on PipeWire 1.6.8 requires the manual
daemon-wide allow.link.passive compatibility opt-in. It applies to every
permitted client of your user PipeWire daemon, not only Aercast. Aercast does
not install, edit, reload, or restart this configuration. Keep System Audio off
unless you opt in; after changing it, sign out and back in:
https://github.com/Xarth-Mai/Aercast/blob/main/docs/development.md#pipewire-168-compatibility
EOF
}
